Here's the structured goal model based on the mission description:

### Goals Table

| Name | Text | Runtime | Goal Type | Relation |
|------|------|---------|-----------|----------|
| G1   | Deliver Required Resources | - | Achieve | - |
| G2   | Collect Resources |ParallelGroup | Perform | AND |
| G3   | Deliver Collected Resources | - | Perform | AND |

### Sub-Goals and Tasks

#### G2: Collect Resources
- **G2.1**: Collect from Storage A (Perform Goal)
  - **AT2.1**: Collect Resources from Storage A (Task)
- **G2.2**: Handle Low Battery During Collection (Perform Goal)
  - **AT2.2**: Recharge and Assign to Another Robot (Task)

#### G3: Deliver Collected Resources
- **G3.1**: Deliver All Resources (Perform Goal)
  - **AT3.1**: Deliver All Resources to Destination (Task)
- **G3.2**: Return Resources to Checkpoint (Perform Goal)
  - **AT3.2**: Return Resources to Checkpoint (Task)

### Relationships
- **G1 -> G2, G3 [AND]**: Both collection and delivery are required.
- **G2 -> G2.1, G2.2 [OR]**: Either collect all resources or handle low battery.
- **G2.1 -> AT2.1 [AND]**: Single task for collecting from a storage.
- **G2 -> AT2.2 [FALLBACK(G2.2, G2.1)]**: If collection fails due to low battery, recharge and assign another robot.
- **G3 -> G3.1, G3.2 [OR]**: Either deliver all resources or return to checkpoint if low battery.
- **G3.1 -> AT3.1 [AND]**: Single task for delivering all resources.
- **G3.2 -> AT3.2 [AND]**: Single task for returning to checkpoint.

### Task Details

| Name | Text | Relation | Location | Number of Robots |
|------|------|----------|----------|------------------|
| AT2.1 | Collect Resources from Storage A | AND | Storage A | 1 |
| AT2.2 | Recharge and Assign to Another Robot | Fallback | Recharging Station | 1 |
| AT3.1 | Deliver All Resources to Destination | AND | Destination | 1 |
| AT3.2 | Return Resources to Checkpoint | AND | Checkpoint | 1 |

This model ensures that the mission is decomposed into manageable goals and tasks, with appropriate fallback mechanisms for battery issues.
